WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.532
Cannabis has a fixed maximum supply of four hundred and twenty

00:00:04.532 --> 00:00:08.240
million tokens. Ninety-nine percent is reserved for community claims.

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:12.940
The founder allocation is one percent: four point two million tokens,

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:17.340
locked at creation and released gradually over twenty-four calendar months from

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:18.540
the public opening.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:23.387
That schedule is written into the contract design. The separate compute

00:00:23.387 --> 00:00:27.933
service fee is one percent of accepted paid work. Explore the

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:31.240
source and see how the rules fit together.
